commit c804f787
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 17:18:36 -0600
subject: feat(combo): context-aware overflow routing to large-context target (FIX-B, card t_f5462249)

applyContextAwareRouting floats the configured overflowTarget to the front
of the attempt list when estimated prompt tokens >= thresholdTokens, so
>200K-token prompts hit Ldial/qwen-3.8-max-thinking instead of failing a
small-context model. tokenEstimate.js adds a CJK-aware heuristic probe.
Wired via chat.js comboStrategies[model].contextAwareRouting; logs
CONTEXT-OVERFLOW-REROUTE; appends x-9r-context-reroute on success.
15 new unit tests (combo-context-aware-routing.test.js).


